{"name":"World Sound","lines":["Somnucor, the city","Your own dream (and the dream journal)","Jules Verne's World","The classic story worlds","The Deep (Atlantis and the mermaids)","Samhain Night (keeps its own music)","Inside: taverns and inns","Inside: churches and chapels","Inside: temples and shrines","Inside: shops and markets","Inside: forges and workshops","Inside: banks, schools, hospitals, offices","Inside: homes (a clock, no music)","Inside: crypts and tombs","Inside: castles and towers","The world's sounds","Effects (fights, doors, steps)","Every world has music and sounds of its own, made by the game as you play. Fights bring in battle music. To silence it all, turn Sound off."]}